; getquad_sample_register: GETQUAD requires MODEL mode.
;
; The read of the trio, and the one that charges nothing on either VM. It
; is here because a read-only opcode is the case where "a sample has no
; quadratic storage" is easiest to answer with 0 instead of a fault --
; which is exactly what xqvm_py did before QUI-1160.

PUSH 4
BSMX r0          ; a SAMPLE, not a model

PUSH 0           ; i
PUSH 1           ; j
GETQUAD r0
HALT
